Planes Overhead uses these works by other people.

maplibre/  MapLibre GL JS 6.15.0, from the npm package maplibre-gl.
           BSD 3-Clause; see maplibre/LICENSE.txt. The source map comments
           were removed from the two .mjs files. Nothing else was changed.

fonts/     B612 and B612 Mono, the typeface Airbus commissioned for cockpit
           displays, from the npm packages @fontsource/b612 and
           @fontsource/b612-mono 5.3.0. SIL Open Font License 1.1; see
           fonts/OFL.txt.

Data, fetched when the app runs and not stored in this repository:

Flight positions  adsb.lol, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
                  https://adsb.lol
Flight routes     adsbdb, https://www.adsbdb.com. Route data is the work of
and aircraft      David Taylor and Jim Mason. Aircraft data comes from
                  PlaneBase. Neither is copied or stored by this app beyond a
                  single viewing.
Base map          OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org) with tiles from
                  OpenMapTiles (https://openmaptiles.org) and data from
                  OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL).
